37988>>>>>    Procedure SetActionButtons
37991>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
37991>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
37991>>>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
37991>>>>>        Handle hoDD
37991>>>>>
37991>>>>>        Get Server to hoDD
37992>>>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
37993>>>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
37994>>>>>
37994>>>>>        // let's hide all buttons and then Show the ones we want
37994>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to False
37995>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to False
37996>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to False
37997>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to False
37998>>>>>
37998>>>>>        If (NavigateData.bReadOnly) Begin
38000>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to True
38001>>>>>        End
38001>>>>>>
38001>>>>>        Else Begin
38002>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38003>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38004>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38005>>>>>        End
38005>>>>>>
38005>>>>>    End_Procedure
