38236>>>>>    Procedure SetActionButtons
38239>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38239>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38239>>>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
38239>>>>>        Handle hoDD
38239>>>>>
38239>>>>>        Get Server to hoDD
38240>>>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
38241>>>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
38242>>>>>
38242>>>>>        // let's hide all buttons and then Show the ones we want
38242>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to False
38243>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to False
38244>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to False
38245>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to False
38246>>>>>
38246>>>>>        If (NavigateData.bReadOnly) Begin
38248>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to True
38249>>>>>        End
38249>>>>>>
38249>>>>>        Else Begin
38250>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38251>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38252>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38253>>>>>        End
38253>>>>>>
38253>>>>>    End_Procedure
38254>>>>>
